=== PASS S -- THE SUBTRAHEND, AND WHY DIFFERENCING IS REFUSED ===
hs071_x1_fixed is four variables dense and costs 0.00018 s of solve inside a warm leg,
so a single-row hs071 process is very nearly the per-process constant alone.
  510a4bb   median   4.6121 e9   min   3.2411   max   4.6208   spread 29.915 %
  9cebbbe   median   3.8992 e9   min   3.5549   max   3.9066   spread  9.019 %
  control   median   4.6143 e9   min   4.2206   max   4.7011   spread 10.414 %

The naive repair -- subtract it, row by row -- would read:
